image size     : 32768 bytes = 64 sectors of 512 bytes
LBA 5 starts at byte offset 5 * 512 = 2560
read back      : "hello from LBA 5"
logical sectors per physical sector: 4096 / 512 = 8
LBA  5 -> physical sector 0, slot 5 of 8
LBA  8 -> physical sector 1, slot 0 of 8
LBA 15 -> physical sector 1, slot 7 of 8
LBA 16 -> physical sector 2, slot 0 of 8
